tmdb.org/t/p/original/wytfOgPzYnYUqEbXUyM38HIcYXP.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An ancient skeleton has been discovered in Jerusalem in a rich man's tomb. Colouration of the wrist and leg bones indicates the cause of death was crucifiction. other signs, include a gold coin bearing the marks of Pontius Pilate and faint markings around the skull, lead authorities to suspect that these could be the bones of Jesus Christ. Politicians, clerics, religious extremists and those using terror as a means to an end, find their beliefs and identities tested while risking their lives to unearth the truth.....\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13944,\"title\":\"Passengers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gt7nwosQg6hfQXBcrNkiJPB45qe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a2oBd4B7x7Di8CVkDGCKcvy4TFm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a plane crash, a young therapist, Claire, is assigned by her mentor to counsel the flight's five survivors. When they share their recollections of the incident -- which some say include an explosion that the airline claims never happened -- Claire is intrigued by Eric, the most secretive of the passengers.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10491,\"title\":\"Enigma\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7gBFkDYBqvSzrPOWlpGTXRp97NQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pE334YKo9NNgee3VEGl6VR6gGSZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of the WWII project to crack the code behind the Enigma machine, used by the Germans to encrypt messages sent to their submarines.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20616,\"title\":\"Swimfan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mOAiqOivdVecMu0yhumN6pzDWmo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/asYdN1eS7zvkEJVIQaYqQcqssj6.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ben Cronin has it all: the admiration of his many friends, a terrific girlfriend, and he's on the fast-track to an athletic scholarship. Ben's rock-solid, promising future and romance are turned upside-down with the arrival of Madison Bell. Madison, the new girl in town, quickly sets her sights on the impressionable Ben. While their first few meetings are innocent enough, the obsessive and seductive Madison wants more ... much more.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":505379,\"title\":\"Rebecca\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kGhllBArW7ImDycSMIG5bj6GEPL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rVkptIl9QkhpB5xM6BnUAHOJ43b.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a whirlwind romance with a wealthy widower, a naïve bride moves to his family estate but can't escape the haunting shadow of his late wife.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10944,\"title\":\"In the Cut\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c8Xg0yc8UQwDXooffBNLLs2BvQH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e1hIGr5HTAPPiHNs7fMlW2JMSPl.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"New York City writing professor Frannie Avery has an affair with a police detective who is investigating the murder of a beautiful young woman in her neighborhood.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9616,\"title\":\"The Order\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7kj4TffoKCt4gIrNupr2oqmir69.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7KBJf963tZBijpP6bKOJrxkowGp.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For centuries, a secret Order of priests has existed within the Church. A renegade priest, Father Alex Bernier, is sent to Rome to investigate the mysterious death of one of the Order's most revered members. Following a series of strangely similar killings, Bernier launches an investigation that forces him to confront unimaginable evil.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":301372,\"title\":\"Voice from the Stone\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6pJseCfsd90nA26Jz1HTSuyRzGz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3vuPHwoIZBajv8YKJQZcJihiC3B.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Verena is a nurse who arrives at an old mansion in Italy to help a young boy who has fallen silent since the sudden passing of his mother.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":513409,\"title\":\"Earthquake Bird\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oyKnosHXQ7kkhlGwqsWOvn4RgKR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rhklsYtIITDOdFSmhx2fIH9m9Vn.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Tokyo, Japan, 1989. Lucy Fly, a foreigner who works as a translator, begins a passionate relationship with Teiji, a mysterious man obsessed with photography.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9391,\"title\":\"Enduring Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ogaUARGgXWmNSuh8qnFCcbqVvZL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jogWINBpTbACShEC4ScpSi3m8UY.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two strangers become dangerously close after witnessing a deadly accident.  On a beautiful cloudless day a young couple celebrate their reunion with a picnic.  Joe has planned a postcard-perfect afternoon in the English countryside with his partner, Claire.  But as Joe and Claire prepare to open a bottle of champagne, their idyll comes to an abrupt end.  A hot air balloon drifts into the field, obviously in trouble.  The pilot catches his leg in the anchor rope, while the only passe